/T (Metaverse Insider has tried to compile this market research report to bring a better understanding of  the current landscape of these disruptive technologies. We truly believe it is important to understand  the history of the technologies at play here as many of these technologies are still in their infancy and  the history will help us identify the purpose of these technologies. The current landscape is vast and still  complicated to navigate. This report focused on Mixed Reality and its headsets, the metaverse in general, and  the WEB 3.0 companies which are gaining traction. We have also investigated the technologies that have  massive potential to gain market share. )
