<<
/Title (PROFESSIONALIZATION OF VIRTUAL ASSETS  Web 3.0 andBlockchain Integration has becomeessential for many Virtual Worlds.TheseVirtual Worlds allow users to interact in the Metaverse as they would in real life. They can buy virtual property and they can exchange assets which are many times open source and cross platform. These virtual assets can also be called Non- Fungible Tokens. As of now, NFTs have become synonymous with digital art being sold online. However, NFTs are so much more than that. They can be virtual assets in and out of the metaverse. We investigate virtual assets that we think will be the most valuable in the coming years.)
